ISO/IEC 14496-5 (MPEG-4 Part 5, reference software) - notice required by its licence
=====================================================================================
Sauti contains DATA (the prototype filter of the AAC SSR polyphase quadrature filter bank and the SSR TNS_MAX_BANDS limits, generated by tools/gen_aac_ssr_tables.py) taken from the
ISO/IEC 14496-5 reference software (aacErrRobTrans/gc_pqf_common.c and decdata.c of C050470e_Electronic_inserts, 2009), and an independent implementation of the AAC SSR gain control tool
written after reading the description in that software.  The licence notice of the software module, which must be included in all copies or derivative works, follows verbatim.

